0..77 Comment "// A tuple of optional values: each member takes the component of the product"
78..148 Comment "// the tuple is written at, as a list\'s elements take its element type"
149..219 Comment "// (`data-answered-list.gandr`). `Maybe` is the one `data-maybe.gandr`"
220..298 Comment "// declares. Before the fix each constructor among the members was refused for"
299..375 Comment "// want of a stated type. A result written without its returner, `-> A * B`,"
376..426 Comment "// answers its components as `-> -F (A * B)` does."
427..429 Comment "//"
430..445 Comment "// - see: #2255"
